<h2 id="heading-2">🔧 Complete Feature Breakdown</h2>

<h3 id="heading-h3-0">1. Ultra-Precise Age Calculation</h3>
<p>Our calculator does not simply subtract your birth year from the current year. It accounts for leap years (including complex century leap year rules), variable month lengths (28, 29, 30, or 31 days), timezone differences, and exact time differentials down to the second. The result is 100% accurate age calculation trusted by professionals worldwide.</p>

<h3 id="heading-h3-1">2. Multi-Date Comparison Engine</h3>
<p>Want to know how old you were on your graduation day, wedding date, or any historical event? Simply enter a target date using the intuitive date picker or scroll picker. The tool instantly recalculates your exact age at that specific point in time. Perfect for calculating age at specific milestones, anniversaries, or historical moments.</p>

<h3 id="heading-h3-2">3. Real-Time Birthday Countdown</h3>
<p>See exactly how many months, days, hours, and seconds remain until your next birthday. The countdown updates dynamically and even shows which day of the week your birthday falls on — helping you plan celebrations, book venues, and send invitations well in advance.</p>

<h3 id="heading-h3-3">4. Zodiac Sign Auto-Detection</h3>
<p>Based on your birth date, the tool automatically identifies your Western zodiac sign (Aries through Pisces) with corresponding emoji and characteristics. A fun and engaging feature that is surprisingly useful for astrology enthusiasts, compatibility checking, and self-discovery.</p>

<h3 id="heading-h3-4">5. Visual Life Progress Meter</h3>
<p>See what percentage of the average 80-year human lifespan you have completed. This visual progress bar provides powerful perspective and motivation. Many users find this feature eye-opening and use it as inspiration to pursue goals and cherish every moment.</p>

<h3 id="heading-h3-5">6. Planetary Age Calculator</h3>
<p>Have you ever wondered how old you would be on Mars, Jupiter, or Venus? This unique feature uses NASA planetary orbital period data to calculate your equivalent age on all 8 planets. For example, a 30-year-old on Earth is approximately 16 Mars years old (since Mars takes 687 Earth days to orbit the Sun), and about 2.5 Jupiter years old (Jupiter takes 12 Earth years per orbit). Great for engaging kids in astronomy and science!</p>

<h3 id="heading-h3-6">7. Legends Born on Your Birthday</h3>
<p>Discover which famous personalities — from historical figures to modern celebrities — share your exact birth date. A fascinating way to connect with history, pop culture, and discover interesting facts about your birthday.</p>

<h3 id="heading-h3-7">8. Integrated Retirement Calculator</h3>
<p>Plan your financial future with precision. The retirement calculator shows exactly when you will reach standard retirement age based on your birth year. Know the exact date, countdown in years and days, and start planning your retirement savings strategy today.</p>

<h3 id="heading-h3-8">9. History & Favorites</h3>
<p>All your calculations are saved locally in your browser localStorage. Access your calculation history anytime, reload previous results with one click, and manage your saved data with full control. No data is ever sent to any server.</p>

<h3 id="heading-h3-9">10. Social Share Cards</h3>
<p>Create beautiful, customizable share cards with your age results to share on WhatsApp, Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, or any social platform. Perfect for birthday announcements, milestone celebrations, or just for fun.</p>

