<h2 id="heading-7">❓ Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
<h3>Q1: Is the Age Calculator really free?</h3>
<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes! 100% free with absolutely no hidden costs, no premium tiers, no trial periods, and no "credit card required" tricks. Every single feature — including advanced metrics, planetary ages, zodiac detection, and export options — is completely free for everyone, forever. We monetize through optional ads, not by charging users.</p>

<h3>Q2: Is my birth date stored or shared with third parties?</h3>
<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely not. This is our strongest commitment. All calculations happen entirely within your browser using client-side JavaScript. Your birth date and personal information never leave your device. We do not use tracking cookies, analytics scripts, or data collection on this tool. You can verify this by opening your browser Developer Tools (F12) → Network tab — you will see zero data being transmitted.</p>

<h3>Q3: How accurate is the age calculation?</h3>
<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Extremely accurate — down to the second. Our algorithm accounts for leap years (including the complex rule that century years divisible by 400 are leap years), variable month lengths (28-31 days), and timezone differences. We use JavaScript built-in Date object which is implemented according to ECMAScript standards and is highly reliable.</p>

<h3>Q4: Can I calculate age for past or future dates?</h3>
<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes! Use the "Calculate Age At" field to specify any target date — past, present, or future. Calculate your age on your graduation day, wedding date, 100th birthday, or any historical event. The tool instantly recalculates for any date you choose.</p>

<h3>Q5: Does it work on mobile phones and tablets?</h3>
<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely. The tool is fully responsive and tested on devices from 320px wide phones to 4K ultra-wide monitors. The interface includes a scroll picker option specifically designed for touch screens, making date selection easy on mobile devices. Works on iOS Safari, Android Chrome, and all modern browsers.</p>

<h3>Q6: Do I need to create an account or sign up?</h3>
<p><strong>Answer:</strong> No! No registration, no sign-up, no email required, no phone number, no social media login. Just visit the page, enter your birth date, and get instant results. We believe tools should be accessible instantly without barriers.</p>

<h3>Q7: Can I export or share my results?</h3>
<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes! Three export options are available: (1) Copy to Clipboard — one click copies all metrics as formatted text, (2) Download as Text File — saves a timestamped .txt report to your device, (3) Create Share Card — generates a beautiful image you can share on WhatsApp, Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, or any social platform.</p>

<h2 id="heading-8">🔒 Our Privacy Commitment</h2>
<p>At Centers.pk, your privacy is not just a policy — it is a core engineering principle. This Age Calculator is designed with a <strong>privacy-first architecture:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>✅ <strong>Zero Data Collection:</strong> No personal information is ever collected, stored, or transmitted.</li>
<li>✅ <strong>Client-Side Processing:</strong> All calculations execute entirely in your browser using JavaScript.</li>
<li>✅ <strong>No Cookies:</strong> We do not use tracking cookies or analytics on this tool.</li>
<li>✅ <strong>No Third-Party Scripts:</strong> No external analytics, no tracking pixels, no data brokers.</li>
<li>✅ <strong>Local Storage Only:</strong> Your calculation history is saved in your browser localStorage — you can clear it anytime.</li>
<li>✅ <strong>HTTPS Encryption:</strong> All data between your browser and our server is encrypted with modern TLS 1.3.</li>
<li>✅ <strong>Open Verification:</strong> Open your browser DevTools (F12) → Network tab while using the tool. You will see exactly zero data being sent anywhere.</li>
</ul>

